OL,3,CInvestigation launched into
OL,4,C'unexplained' deaths in Bradford
OL,6,FPolice have launched an investigation
OL,7,Fafter the unexplained deaths of two
OL,8,Fpeople in Bradford.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police were called at
OL,11,F6:55pm on Tuesday (11 August) to
OL,12,Freports that a 52-year-old woman had
OL,13,Fbeen found dead at an address on New
OL,14,FStead Rise.
OL,16,FA second call was received at 7:14pm
OL,17,Fto reports that a 59-year-old man had
OL,18,Fbeen found dead at a business premises
OL,19,Fon the Tong Park Industrial Estate in
OL,20,FBaildon.
