OL,3,CInvestigation launched into
OL,4,C'unexplained' deaths in Bradford
OL,6,FBoth deaths are currently being
OL,7,Ftreated as unexplained.
OL,9,FPolice have confirmed that the two
OL,10,Fpeople were known to each other and
OL,11,Fthat no one else is being sought in
OL,12,Fconnection with their deaths.
OL,14,FEnquiries are ongoing.
